ation":"Dutch is an official language of Aruba alongside Papiamento, the island\'s widely spoken local language.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-556b-7d2a-b7e9-5b3c76c08761","description":"Dutch","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-556b-72c9-92d5-34c27d4a92e2","description":"Spanish","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-556b-72ac-9d92-7a390a2af2bd","description":"English","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-556b-7494-9f9a-b2962bc664a5","description":"French","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-556b-7881-8516-d01f8988c0bd","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"The language \'Burmese\' belongs to which language family?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Burmese belongs to the Sino-Tibetan family, in its Tibeto-Burman branch.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-556b-7efd-bccf-20cadacf02d6","description":"Sino-Tibetan","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-556b-70bf-ace3-5c5078151ac6","description":"Austronesian","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-556b-7819-a16a-9f16eb85b013","description":"Indo-European","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-556b-799a-b943-dcddcb011dae","description":"Kra\u2013Dai","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-556b-7871-9532-34899425758d","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"In the bible, who says, \"I will now turn aside, and see this great sight, why the bush is not burnt\"?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Moses encounters the burning bush in Exodus, where God calls him to lead the Israelites out of Egypt.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-556b-7e2b-83e1-db416f61f394","description":"Moses","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-556b-751a-be0a-4c50a3852b8c","description":"Goliath","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-556b-744d-ad14-e8775cda8d8a","description":"King Herod","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-556b-7616-a9df-ddf4f3165950","description":"Jesus","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-556b-71ef-8dcd-8831f58d441b","locale