lso an English statesman whose emphasis on observation and experiment helped shape modern scientific inquiry.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-556b-7e35-b21e-d8c6f6263336","description":"Francis Bacon","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-556b-7c92-9cb2-db3b4c1c40fe","description":"Jean-Paul Sartre","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-556b-7ef5-9901-d84159732772","description":"Socrates","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-556b-7d7a-82a5-65dd6cd4418c","description":"William of Ockham","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-556b-7ff6-abc7-9004166b4436","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"Which of these languages would you find spoken in Angola?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Portuguese is Angola\u2019s official language, a legacy of its colonial history.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-556b-7450-b1cf-345e0d438608","description":"Portuguese","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-556b-7eed-b02a-3dd51793fc3c","description":"Hindi","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-556b-7fbd-b1de-65ecba849398","description":"Berber","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-556b-7bcc-9321-4678a6184c58","description":"Gujarati","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-556b-7b57-9e06-0bae09cad951","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"The language \'Bengali\' belongs to which language family?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Bengali is an Indo-Aryan language, a branch of the Indo-European family.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-556b-77b1-85f3-76cf9550295d","description":"Indo-European","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-556b-79cf-b357-09a290729378","description":"Afroasiatic","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-556b-7961-9b92-4b6361bf6635","description":"Sino-Tibetan","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-556b-7886-80fa-14e3ea6d0f78","description":"Uralic","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-556b-7317-bcc3-7964d491cfdd","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-