49e2de82914a","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"What organisation is based in the Lubjlyanka building?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"The FSB is Russia\'s domestic security and counterintelligence agency, and it succeeded the KGB after the Soviet Union dissolved.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-556c-743a-8184-d6eaffa1f583","description":"The FSB","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-556c-735a-a57c-bc7022060eff","description":"The EU","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-556c-79a5-9a4c-a4668d385502","description":"The WHO","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-556c-7892-a106-bbcb3322f233","description":"Interpol","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-556c-7c11-b94a-0da911957715","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"Which official is first in the statutory line to act as President if both the President and Vice President can no longer serve?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"The Presidential Succession Act places the Speaker of the House ahead of cabinet officials in the succession order.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-556c-7766-92b0-81724f9341b0","description":"The Speaker of the House","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb-556c-7a91-bc26-45f43c45f465","description":"The Secretary of State","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-556c-7422-8afc-d80c8e20c9f7","description":"The Secretary of Defense","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a218eb-556c-7c88-a4dc-aeb60001bd6d","description":"The Attorney General","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a218eb-556c-7ede-b738-c9af22adb103","locale":"en-US","category":"01a21312-b489-7dd6-93ca-116c8464996a","question":"Which of these languages would you find spoken in Pakistan?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"In Pakistan, Punjabi is commonly written in the Shahmukhi script, which is based on the Perso-Arabic alphabet.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a218eb-556c-7f3b-8c2c-b6e39bd973a5","description":"Punjabi","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a218eb